  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/docs1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review at dev 100b6fbb6e: meta_key_coherence.py still documents Symbol construction as unseen and check-producer-axis-coherence has no Symbol.meta axis. Re-measured with the item's enumeration (_iter_file_sites, Symbol/Symbol.create, meta=, helper descent): 216 distinct keys, 49 registered on symbol_meta, 31 registered only on another axis, 136 unregistered, 47 unenumerable sites (was 206/137/31/21). Premise holds; counts drifted. MECHANISM: meta-key registration gate enumerates only Edge constructors; no Symbol arm or ratchet axis. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-janon."  # 40d7
